%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dCalm down, Mitoko.\d%K%P
「美都子，冷静点…」%K%P
%LCMitoko
%LC美都子
\dMr. Laid-off...\d%K%P
「失业先生…」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dUm... long time no see... I guess?\d%K%P
「那个，好久不见了，呐」%K%P
%LCMitoko
%LC美都子
\d...\d%K%P
「………」%K%P
Mitoko looked up at my face. It had been only a week since\nwe last saw each other, but I couldn't help being\novertaken by a strong feeling of nostalgia.%K%P
美都子的视线，直直地撞上了我的脸。\n只是一周没见面，却感觉相当怀念。%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dU-Um... I'm sorry for being unable to come back last\nweek. And failing to contact you about it.\d%K%P
「那、那个…抱歉上周最后没有回去。\n也没有联系，很抱歉」%K%P
%LCMitoko
%LC美都子
\d...\d%K%P
「………」%K%P
Mitoko's gaze scrutinized me from top to bottom. I\nwondered if she, too, was feeling this nostalgic\nsensation.%K%P
美都子接着打量了我的全身。\n她应该也和我一样感到怀念吧。%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dAlso, uh, I... I'm sorry. I might not be able to pay this\nmonth's rent right away.\d%K%P
「还有，还有，还有，啊…\n那个，这个月的房租，不能马上支付了…」%K%P
%LCMitoko
%LC美都子
\d...\d%K%P
「………」%K%P
Mitoko's gaze travelled down to my feet. Or maybe she was\njust trying to avoid my eyes.%K%P
视线现在又移动到了我的脚上。\n或者说，她只是低下了头。%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dI tried my best, but I know that's only an excuse. I'm a\nuseless man through and through.\d%K%P
「我努力了…呃，即使把“努力”当作辩解也无济于事了吧。\n我真是个连辩解都不会的废柴啊」%K%P
%LCMitoko
%LC美都子
\d...\d%K%P
「………」%K%P
Mitoko began to slowly raise her head. Her shoulders were\ntrembling.%K%P
视线又再次慢慢抬高。\n连带着，她的肩膀，颤动着。%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dBut... But I still...\d%K%P
「即便如此，即便如此…」%K%P
Her gaze settled on my face, and after slightly twisting\nher body to the right, she...%K%P
视线最后再一次回到我的脸上。\n接着，一点点，朝右扭动身体…%K%P
%LCMitoko
%LC美都子
\d...\d%K%P
「………」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dHuh?\d%K%P
「诶…？」%K%P
